## Prerequisites

- Node.js (v24+)
- [wrangler](https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/wrangler/) (`npm install -g wrangler`)
- [groo CLI](https://github.com/groo-dev/cli) (`brew install groo-dev/tap/groo`)

